            <mattext texttype="text/html">&lt;span class="TextRun SCXW189111605 BCX8" lang="EN-US" data-contrast="auto"&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW189111605 BCX8"&gt;Companionship is defined as friends having common values and interests and enjoying each other's company.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="EOP SCXW189111605 BCX8" data-ccp-props="{}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;</mattext>
