            <mattext texttype="text/html">&lt;span class="TextRun SCXW63904686 BCX8" lang="EN-US" data-contrast="auto"&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW63904686 BCX8"&gt;This statement is false. Successful family communication involves open dialogue, including discussing disagreements and actively working to solve problems, rather than exclusively focusing on positive experiences and avoiding conflicts. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="EOP SCXW63904686 BCX8" data-ccp-props="{}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;</mattext>
